��i<?php exit; ?>a:2:{s:7:"content";O:8:"stdClass":24:{s:2:"ID";i:5366;s:11:"post_author";s:1:"1";s:9:"post_date";s:19:"2026-04-01 09:57:03";s:13:"post_date_gmt";s:19:"2026-04-01 09:57:03";s:12:"post_content";s:1357:"<p>If you are planning a similar initiative, start with a thin end-to-end slice, instrument it in production, and expand scope only when telemetry supports the next bet.</p><ul class="blog-details__list"><li>Rotate who runs ceremonies</li><li>Fund team meals with real budgets</li><li>Never let crisis mode erase gratitude</li></ul><p>Rituals that feel forced die fast. Celebrations work when they reflect how teams actually win—shipping, learning, helping a customer breathe easier.</p><figure class="blog-details__figure wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://nsc.test/wp-content/themes/NSC-Software/frontend/build/img/blog1.webp" alt="Celebrating Wins: Team Rituals at NSC — team collaboration" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="675" /></figure><p class="blog-details__lead">Rituals that feel forced die fast. Celebrations work when they reflect how teams actually win—shipping, learning, helping a customer breathe easier.</p><blockquote class="blog-details__blockquote"><p>AI in delivery is a force multiplier only when humans own the oracles, the sampling strategy, and the story you tell stakeholders.</p></blockquote><h2 class="blog-details__h2">What this means for your next quarter</h2><p>NSC ends quarters with “shout-out walls” that include support, QA, and ops—not only commit heroes.</p><hr class="blog-details__divider" />";s:10:"post_title";s:37:"Celebrating Wins: Team Rituals at NSC";s:12:"post_excerpt";s:281:"Celebrating Wins: Team Rituals at NSC — Rituals that feel forced die fast. Celebrations work when they reflect how teams actually win—shipping, learning, helping a customer breathe easier. Remote confetti emojis help, but so do bonuses tied to collective outcomes and public…";s:11:"post_status";s:7:"publish";s:14:"comment_status";s:4:"open";s: